WEBVTT

00:32:59.267 --> 00:33:01.381
that they want me to compromise

00:33:01.381 --> 00:33:03.556
the journalists with which I've been working,

00:33:03.556 --> 00:33:04.989
to come back,

00:33:04.989 --> 00:33:07.542
and I want to make it very clear

00:33:07.542 --> 00:33:10.268
that I did not do this to be safe.

00:33:10.268 --> 00:33:12.536
I did this to do what was right,

00:33:12.536 --> 00:33:14.763
and I'm not going to stop my work

00:33:14.763 --> 00:33:16.137
in the public interest

00:33:16.137 --> 00:33:18.926
just to benefit myself.

00:33:18.926 --> 00:33:24.704
(Applause)

00:33:24.704 --> 00:33:26.623
CA: In the meantime,

00:33:26.623 --> 00:33:30.391
courtesy of the Internet and this technology,